# Quitting while editing a Today entry saves the edit, and reopening shows the Today view on that entry in navigate mode.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Review PRs @due({today})
END
keys gt j <Enter>
type  today
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Review PRs today @due({today})
END
restart
see 󰖙 Today
status NAVIGATE
keys x
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Review PRs today @due({today}) @done({today})
END
